---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Support | Low Value Content" description="Support information for Low Value Content orders and product questions.">
  <article class="support"><p class="eyebrow">Royal Office of Practical Matters</p><h1>Support, plainly stated.</h1><p>Commercial matters are administered in direct language. Product status, payment, fulfillment, and customer rights shall remain unambiguous.</p><section><h2>Before launch</h2><p>The current storefront contains development issues and one restricted test checkout configuration. General sales and public customer support have not yet opened.</p></section><section><h2>Order status</h2><p>Customers with a valid order token will be able to view payment, production, shipment, and delivery status through the existing order-status service.</p></section><section><h2>Final policies</h2><p>Shipping, return, replacement, sizing, care, and contact information will be published before products become publicly purchasable.</p></section></article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.support{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) clamp(1.25rem,9vw,10rem);min-height:75vh;background:var(--paper)}h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem);line-height:.86;font-weight:400;margin:1rem 0 3rem}.support>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:720px}.support section{max-width:780px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:2rem 0}.support h2{font-size:2rem;font-weight:400}.support section p{line-height:1.7}</style>
